#: src/routes/(public)/gateway/index.tsx:19
msgid "Neore Gateway — unified LLM API for OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, xAI, Groq, and Mistral. Smart routing, automatic fallback, real-time usage tracking, and cost optimization. One API key, every model."
msgstr "Neore Gateway — 面向 OpenAI、Google、Anthropic、xAI、Groq 和 Mistral 的统一 LLM API。智能路由、自动回退、实时用量跟踪和成本优化。一个 API 密钥，所有模型。"

#: src/features/marketing/components/gateway-landing-page.tsx:175
msgid "Neore Gateway is a unified LLM API proxy that sits between your application and AI providers like OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, xAI, Groq, and Mistral. It provides smart model routing, automatic fallback, usage tracking, and cost optimization — all through a single, OpenAI-compatible API endpoint."
msgstr "Neore Gateway 是一个统一的 LLM API 代理，位于你的应用与 OpenAI、Google、Anthropic、xAI、Groq、Mistral 等 AI 提供商之间。它通过单一的 OpenAI 兼容 API 端点，提供智能模型路由、自动故障转移、用量追踪和成本优化。"

#: src/features/marketing/components/gateway-landing-page.tsx:195
msgid "Neore Gateway runs on Cloudflare Workers at 300+ edge locations. Cold start is under 50ms. The proxy overhead is typically 5-15ms. Provider response times are the main latency factor, and smart routing selects the fastest healthy provider for each request."
msgstr "Neore Gateway 运行在 Cloudflare Workers 的 300+ 个边缘节点上。冷启动不到 50ms，代理开销通常为 5-15ms。提供商响应时间是主要延迟因素，智能路由会为每个请求选择最快的健康提供商。"

#: src/features/marketing/components/gateway-landing-page.tsx:183
msgid "Neore Gateway supports OpenAI (GPT-4o, o1, o3, DALL-E), Google (Gemini 2.5, Imagen, Veo), Anthropic (Claude 4), xAI (Grok 3), Groq (LLaMA, Mixtral), Mistral (Large, Codestral), and more via OpenRouter. New providers are added regularly."
msgstr "Neore Gateway 支持 OpenAI（GPT-4o、o1、o3、DALL-E）、Google（Gemini 2.5、Imagen、Veo）、Anthropic（Claude 4）、xAI（Grok 3）、Groq（LLaMA、Mixtral）、Mistral（Large、Codestral），并可通过 OpenRouter 使用更多模型。我们会定期添加新的提供商。"

#: src/features/marketing/components/landing-page.tsx:255
msgid "Neore includes 30+ models: GPT-4, Claude, Gemini, and DeepSeek for chat. FLUX, Imagen, Stable Diffusion, and Recraft for images. Runway, Luma, Kling, and Pika for video. Switch between any of them mid-conversation."
msgstr "Neore 包含 30+ 个模型：聊天有 GPT-4、Claude、Gemini 和 DeepSeek；图像有 FLUX、Imagen、Stable Diffusion 和 Recraft；视频有 Runway、Luma、Kling 和 Pika。可在对话中随时切换。"

